{"id":"136d21829e234687","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery.md","title":"Theorem II.6 Recovery of an Étale Bundle","display":"Theorem II.6 Recovery of an Étale Bundle","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery","aliases":["14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery"],"display":"Theorem II.6 Recovery of an Étale Bundle","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","[[14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.6 Theorem 2 and Corollary 3, printed 89–91; DjVu 50–51","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.6 Recovery of an Étale Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f84b744ac7e877e9\" href=\"?note=f84b744ac7e877e9\" title=\"14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections\">14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6 Theorem 2 and Corollary 3, printed 89–91; DjVu 50–51"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:(E,\\sigma)\\to(X,\\tau)\">\\(p:(E,\\sigma)\\to(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_Xp\">\\(\\Gamma_Xp\\)</span> 为截面层；茎空间使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a>。若要求同胚，则另外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> étale。另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上任意预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_P\">\\(p_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_P\">\\(E_P\\)</span> 及单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_P\">\\(\\eta_P\\)</span> 分别沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_p:E_{\\Gamma_Xp}\\to E,\\qquad\\varepsilon_p(x,[(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=s(x),\\qquad p\\varepsilon_p=p_{\\Gamma_Xp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_p:E_{\\Gamma_Xp}\\to E,\\qquad\\varepsilon_p(x,[(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=s(x),\\qquad p\\varepsilon_p=p_{\\Gamma_Xp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(\\varepsilon_p;E_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\sigma_{\\Gamma_Xp};E,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cont}(\\varepsilon_p;E_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\sigma_{\\Gamma_Xp};E,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Homeo}(\\varepsilon_p;E_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\sigma_{\\Gamma_Xp};E,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Homeo}(\\varepsilon_p;E_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\sigma_{\\Gamma_Xp};E,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_X(\\varepsilon_p)\\circ\\eta_{\\Gamma_Xp}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\qquad\\varepsilon_{p_P}\\circ\\Lambda_X(\\eta_P)=\\mathrm{id}_{E_P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_X(\\varepsilon_p)\\circ\\eta_{\\Gamma_Xp}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\Gamma_Xp},\\qquad\\varepsilon_{p_P}\\circ\\Lambda_X(\\eta_P)=\\mathrm{id}_{E_P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等茎截面在点上取值相同，故评价映射良定义；它在每个基本茎图上等于原连续截面，因此连续。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> étale，每个点都有局部截面经过，所以满射；两截面若同点取相同值，局部同胚图迫使它们在邻域上相等，所以单射。局部图同时说明逆连续。两条三角恒等式均逐截面、逐茎计算。因单位在层上、余单位在 étale bundle 上都是同构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_X\">\\(\\Gamma_X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_X\">\\(\\Lambda_X\\)</span> 限制成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\simeq\\mathbf{Etale}(X)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\simeq\\mathbf{Etale}(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer